# Default MSBuild command-line switches for this repository.
#
# Node reuse keeps MSBuild worker nodes alive between builds. With several agents
# building concurrently in parallel worktrees, those nodes wedge and every later
# build queues behind them instead of starting its own (observed 2026-08-07:
# 11 stacked `dotnet build` processes, the oldest blocked for 3.5 hours, all at
# ~0% CPU). Disabling reuse also disables MSBuild Server, which has the same
# failure mode.
#
# Applies to `dotnet build` / `msbuild` command-line builds only — Rider and
# Visual Studio do not read .rsp files.
-nodeReuse:false
